front of; ahead of.", "meaning_fa": "جلوی، پیش از", "example_en": "The car stopped right before the gate.", "photo": "media/vocab/before-place.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/before-place.mp3"}, {"word": "beginning", "phonetic": "bɪˈgɪnɪŋ", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "The start of something, a place or time.", "meaning_fa": "آغاز، شروع", "example_en": "The park is at the beginning of the street.", "photo": "media/vocab/beginning.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/beginning.mp3"}, {"word": "below", "phonetic": "bɪˈləʊ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "In a lower place or position than.", "meaning_fa": "زیر، پایین", "example_en": "The temperature is below zero today.", "photo": "media/vocab/below.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/below.mp3"}, {"word": "beneath", "phonetic": "bɪˈniːθ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Under something, in a lower position.", "meaning_fa": "زیر، در پایین", "example_en": "The treasure was hidden beneath the old tree.", "photo": "media/vocab/beneath.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/beneath.mp3"}, {"word": "beside [next to]", "phonetic": "bɪˈsaɪd", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Next to someone or something.", "meaning_fa": "کنار، پهلوی", "example_en": "She sat beside her friend.", "photo": "media/vocab/beside-next-to.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/beside-next-to.mp3"}, {"word": "beyond", "phonetic": "bɪˈjɒnd", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "On the far side of something.", "meaning_fa": "فراتر از، آن سوی", "example_en": "The mountains are beyond the river.", "photo": "media/vocab/beyond.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/beyond.mp3"}, {"word": "bottom", "phonetic": "ˈbɒtəm", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "The lowest part of something.", "meaning_fa": "پایین، ته", "example_en": "The book fell to the bottom of the stairs.", "photo": "media/vocab/bottom.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/bottom.mp3"}, {"word": "breadth", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "The distance from one side to the other.", "meaning_fa": "عرض، پهنا", "example_en": "The breadth of the river was about 50 meters.", "photo": "media/vocab/breadth.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/breadth.mp3"}, {"word": "broad", "phonetic": "brɔːd", "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Wide; covering a large area.", "meaning_fa": "پهن، گسترده", "example_en": "He has broad shoulders.", "photo": "media/vocab/broad.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/broad.mp3"}, {"word": "broaden", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "make something wider or more general", "meaning_fa": "وسیع کردن، گسترش دادن", "example_en": "Travel can broaden your mind.", "photo": "media/vocab/broaden.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/broaden.mp3"}, {"word": "broadminded", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "willing to accept different ideas and opinions", "meaning_fa": "روشن‌فکر، باگذشت", "example_en": "She is very broadminded about other cultures.", "photo": "media/vocab/broadminded.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/broadminded.mp3"}, {"word": "by [near]", "phonetic": "baɪ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Close to or next to a place.", "meaning_fa": "کنار، نزدیک", "example_en": "The cafe is by the river.", "photo": "media/vocab/by-near.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/by-near.mp3"}, {"word": "by [next to]", "phonetic": "baɪ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Positioned beside something or someone.", 