ns looked beautiful at sunset.", "photo": "media/vocab/distant.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/distant.mp3"}, {"word": "down [further along]", "phonetic": "daʊn", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "Further along a road or path.", "meaning_fa": "جلوتر، پایین‌تر", "example_en": "The shop is just down the street.", "photo": "media/vocab/down-further-along.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/down-further-along.mp3"}, {"word": "down [to a lower place]", "phonetic": "daʊn", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "To a lower position or place.", "meaning_fa": "پایین، به سمت پایین", "example_en": "Please sit down on the chair.", "photo": "media/vocab/down-to-a-lower-place.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/down-to-a-lower-place.mp3"}, {"word": "end", "phonetic": "end", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "The final part of something.", "meaning_fa": "پایان، انتها", "example_en": "We live at the end of the street.", "photo": "media/vocab/end.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/end.mp3"}, {"word": "enormous", "phonetic": "ɪˈnɔːməs", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Extremely large.", "meaning_fa": "عظیم، بزرگ", "example_en": "The elephant is an enormous animal.", "photo": "media/vocab/enormous.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/enormous.mp3"}, {"word": "everywhere", "phonetic": "ˈevrɪweə", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "In all places.", "meaning_fa": "همه جا", "example_en": "I looked everywhere for my phone.", "photo": "media/vocab/everywhere.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/everywhere.mp3"}, {"word": "expand", "phonetic": "ɪkˈspænd", "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "To become bigger or make something bigger.", "meaning_fa": "گسترش دادن، بزرگ کردن", "example_en": "The company wants to expand its business next year.", "photo": "media/vocab/expand.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/expand.mp3"}, {"word": "extend", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "To make something longer or bigger.", "meaning_fa": "گسترش دادن، طولانی کردن", "example_en": "We plan to extend our garden by a few meters.", "photo": "media/vocab/extend.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/extend.mp3"}, {"word": "far", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "At or to a great distance.", "meaning_fa": "دور، فاصله زیاد", "example_en": "How far is it to the next town?", "photo": "media/vocab/far.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/far.mp3"}, {"word": "faraway", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "A long distance away.", "meaning_fa": "دوردست", "example_en": "She dreams of traveling to faraway lands.", "photo": "media/vocab/faraway.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/faraway.mp3"}, {"word": "feet [measurement]", "phonetic": "fiːt", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "A unit of length, one foot is 30.48 cm.", "meaning_fa": "فوت (واحد اندازه گیری)", "example_en": "The tree is about twenty feet tall.", "photo": "media/vocab/feet-measurement.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/feet-measurement.mp3"}, {"word": "front", "phonetic": "frʌnt", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "the part that faces forward.", "meaning_fa": "جلو، روبرو", "example_en": "The car's front is damaged.", "photo": "media/vocab/front.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/front.mp3"}, {"word": "giant", "phonetic": "ˈʤaɪənt", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Extremely large.", "meaning_fa": "غول پیکر، بسیار بزرگ", "example_en": "They built a giant new shopping mall.", "photo": "media/vocab/giant.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/giant.mp3"}, {"word": "height", "phonetic": "haɪt", "levels": ["b1", "b2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "How tall a person or thing is.", "meaning_fa": "قد، ارتفاع", "example_en": "What is your height?", "photo": "media/vocab/height.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/height.mp3"}, {"word": "heighten", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "To make something stronger or more intense.", "meaning_fa": "تشدید کردن، افزایش دادن", "example_en": "The loud music heightened the excitement of the party.", "photo": "media/vocab/heighten.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/heighten.mp3"}, {"word": "here", "phonetic": "hɪə", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "In this place.", "meaning_fa": "اینجا", "example_en": "Come here, please.", "photo": "media/vocab/here.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/here.mp3"}, {"word": "high (mountain)", "phonetic": "haɪ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Extending a long way up from the ground.", "meaning_fa": "بلند، مرتفع", "example_en": "Mount Everest is a very high mountain.", "photo": "media/vocab/high-mountain.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/high-mountain.mp3"}, {"word": "home", "phonetic": "həʊm", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "The place where you live.", "meaning_fa": "خانه", "example_en": "I want to go home now.", "photo": "media/vocab/home.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/home.mp3"}, {"word": "How long/wide (etc.) is …?", "phonetic": "haʊ lɒŋ/waɪd x ɪz", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "phrase", "meaning_en": "Used to ask about the measurement of something.", "meaning_fa": "طول/عرض ... چقدر است؟", "example_en": "How long is the river?", "photo": "media/vocab/how-long-wide-etc-is.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/how-long-wide-etc-is.mp3"}, {"word": "huge", "phonetic": "hjuːʤ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Very, very big.", "meaning_fa": "عظیم، بزرگ", "example_en": "They live in a huge house.", "photo": "media/vocab/huge.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/huge.mp3"}, {"word": "in", "phonetic": "ɪn", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Inside a place or container.", "meaning_fa": "در، داخل", "example_en": "The books are in the bag.", "photo": "media/vocab/in.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/in.mp3"}, {"word": "in [place]", "phonetic": "ɪn", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Located inside a specific area or building.", "meaning_fa": "در (مکان)", "example_en": "She lives in a small village.", "photo": "media/vocab/in-place.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/in-place.mp3"}, {"word": "inch", "phonetic": "ɪntʃ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "A unit of length, about 2.54 centimeters.", "meaning_fa": "اینچ (واحد طول)", "example_en": "The screen is 15 inches wide.", "photo": "media/vocab/inch.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/inch.mp3"}, {"word": "into", "phonetic": "ˈɪntəː", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "To the inside of something.", "meaning_fa": "به داخل، درون", "example_en": "She walked into the room.", "photo": "media/vocab/into.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/into.mp3"}, {"word": "left", "phonetic": "left", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "The opposite direction to right.", "meaning_fa": "چپ", "example_en": "Turn left at the traffic lights.", "photo": "media/vocab/left.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/left.mp3"}, {"word": "length", "phonetic": "leŋθ", "levels": ["b1", "b2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "How long something is from end to end.", "meaning_fa": "طول", "example_en": "The length of the room is five meters.", "photo": "media/vocab/length.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/length.mp3"}, {"word": "lengthen", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "To make something longer.", "meaning_fa": "طولانی کردن", "example_en": "We need to lengthen the rope.", "photo": "media/vocab/lengthen.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/lengthen.mp3"}, {"word": "lengthy", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Very long, often too long.", "meaning_fa": "طولانی", "example_en": "The meeting was lengthy and boring.", "photo": "media/vocab/lengthy.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/lengthy.mp3"}, {"word": "long", "phonetic": "lɒŋ", "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Measuring a great distance from end to end.", "meaning_fa": "بلند، دراز", "example_en": "She has long hair.", "photo": "media/vocab/long.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/long.mp3"}, {"word": "long-distance", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "travelling or communicating over a great distance.", "meaning_fa": "مسافت طولانی، راه دور", "example_en": "She runs long-distance races every weekend.", "photo": "media/vocab/long-distance.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/long-distance.mp3"}, {"word": "low", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "not high; close to the ground.", "meaning_fa": "پایین، کم", "example_en": "The sun was low in the sky.", "photo": "media/vocab/low.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/low.mp3"}, {"word": "lower", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "make something less in amount or degree.", "meaning_fa": "کاهش دادن، پایین آوردن", "example_en": "You should lower your blood pressure.", "photo": "media/vocab/lower.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/lower.mp3"}, {"word": "metal", "phonetic": "ˈmetəl", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "A hard, shiny material like iron or gold.", "meaning_fa": "فلز", "example_en": "This table is made of metal.", "photo": "media/vocab/metal.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/metal.mp3"}, {"word": "middle", "phonetic": "ˌmɪdəl", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "The central point or part.", "meaning_fa": "وسط، میانه", "example_en": "The book is in the middle of the table.", "photo": "media/vocab/middle.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/middle.mp3"}, {"word": "mile", "phonetic": "maɪl", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "A unit of distance, about 1.6 kilometers.", "meaning_fa": "مایل", "example_en": "The nearest town is five miles away.", "photo": "media/vocab/mile.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/mile.mp3"}, {"word": "narrow", "phonetic": "ˈnærəʊ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Not wide; having little width.", "meaning_fa": "باریک", "example_en": "The road was very narrow.", "photo": "media/vocab/narrow.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/narrow.mp3"}, {"word": "narrow-minded", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Not open to new ideas or opinions.", "meaning_fa": "کوته‌فکر، متعصب", "example_en": "He is too narrow-minded to accept new ideas.", "photo": "media/vocab/narrow-minded.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/narrow-minded.mp3"}, {"word": "nearest", "phonetic": "ˈnɪərɪst", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Closest in distance.", "meaning_fa": "نزدیک‌ترین", "example_en": "Where is the nearest bus stop?", "photo": "media/vocab/nearest.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/nearest.mp3"}, {"word": "on", "phonetic": "ɒn", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Positioned above and touching something.", "meaning_fa": "روی، بر روی", "example_en": "The book is on the table.", "photo": "media/vocab/on.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/on.mp3"}, {"word": "on [place]", "phonetic": "ɒn", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Located at a specific place or surface.", "meaning_fa": "روی، در", "example_en": "The picture is on the wall.", "photo": "media/vocab/on-place.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/on-place.mp3"}, {"word": "on the left", "phonetic": "ɒn ðə left", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "phrase", "meaning_en": "To the left side.", "meaning_fa": "در سمت چپ", "example_en": "The shop is on the left.", "photo": "media/vocab/on-the-left.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/on-the-left.mp3"}, {"word": "on the right", "phonetic": "ɒn ðə raɪt", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "phrase", "meaning_en": "To the right side.", "meaning_fa": "در سمت راست", "example_en": "The park is on the right.", "photo": "media/vocab/on-the-right.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/on-the-right.mp3"}, {"word": "out", "phonetic": "aʊt", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "Away from a place or inside.", "meaning_fa": "بیرون", "example_en": "Let's go out for dinner tonight.", "photo": "media/vocab/out.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/out.mp3"}, {"word": "out of", "phonetic": "aʊt ɒv", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "From inside to outside.", "meaning_fa": "از داخلِ، از", "example_en": "He took a book out of his bag.", "photo": "media/vocab/out-of.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/out-of.mp3"}, {"word": "over [movement]", "phonetic": "ˈəʊvə", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Moving from one side to another, often above.", "meaning_fa": "از روی، بر فراز", "example_en": "The bird flew over the house.", "photo": "media/vocab/over-movement.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/over-movement.mp3"}, {"word": "position", "phonetic": "pəˈzɪʃən", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "The place where someone or something is.", "meaning_fa": "موقعیت، جایگاه", "example_en": "What is your current position?", "photo": "media/vocab/position.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/position.mp3"}, {"word": "quite a long way", "phonetic": "kwaɪt ə lɒŋ weɪ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "phrase", "meaning_en": "a long distance", "meaning_fa": "راه نسبتاً طولانی", "example_en": "It's quite a long way to the beach.", "photo": "media/vocab/quite-a-long-way.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/quite-a-long-way.mp3"}, {"word": "right", "phonetic": "raɪt", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "On the side that is not left.", "meaning_fa": "راست، سمت راست", "example_en": "Turn right at the traffic lights.", "photo": "media/vocab/right.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/right.mp3"}, {"word": "right [exactly]", "phonetic": "raɪt", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "Exactly or precisely.", "meaning_fa": "دقیقا، درست", "example_en": "The shop is right next to the bank.", "photo": "media/vocab/right-exactly.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/right-exactly.mp3"}, {"word": "round [movement]", "phonetic": "raʊnd", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Moving in a circle or curve.", "meaning_fa": "دور، اطراف", "example_en": "We walked round the lake.", "photo": "media/vocab/round-movement.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/round-movement.mp3"}, {"word": "round the corner", "phonetic": "raʊnd ðə ˈkɔːnə", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "phrase", "meaning_en": "Very near, happening soon.", "meaning_fa": "نزدیک، در شرف وقوع", "example_en": "The shop is just round the corner.", "photo": "media/vocab/round-the-corner.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/round-the-corner.mp3"}, {"word": "shallow", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "not deep", "meaning_fa": "کم‌عمق", "example_en": "The water in the pool is very shallow.", "photo": "media/vocab/shallow.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/shallow.mp3"}, {"word": "shortcut", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "A quicker way to get somewhere.", "meaning_fa": "میانبر", "example_en": "Let's take a shortcut through the park.", "photo": "media/vocab/shortcut.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/shortcut.mp3"}, {"word": "shorten", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "To make something shorter.", "meaning_fa": "کوتاه کردن", "example_en": "Can you shorten these trousers for me?", "photo": "media/vocab/shorten.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/shorten.mp3"}, {"word": "side", "phonetic": "saɪd", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "A part of your body between your ribs and hip.", "meaning_fa": "پهلو", "example_en": "I have a pain in my side.", "photo": "media/vocab/side.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/side.mp3"}, {"word": "size", "phonetic": "saɪz", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "How big or small something is.", "meaning_fa": "اندازه", "example_en": "What size is this shirt?", "photo": "media/vocab/size.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/size.mp3"}, {"word": "spread", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "Affect a larger area or more people.", "meaning_fa": "گسترش یافتن، پخش شدن", "example_en": "The disease spread quickly in the city.", "photo": "media/vocab/spread.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/spread.mp3"}, {"word": "stretch", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "To extend over an area or distance.", "meaning_fa": "امتداد یافتن", "example_en": "The road stretches for miles.", "photo": "media/vocab/stretch.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/stretch.mp3"}, {"word": "tall person/tree/building", "phonetic": "tɔːl ˈpɜːsən/triː/ˈbɪldɪŋ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "Having a great height.", "meaning_fa": "بلند (قد، درخت، ساختمان)", "example_en": "That is a very tall building.", "photo": "media/vocab/tall-person-tree-building.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/tall-person-tree-building.mp3"}, {"word": "there", "phonetic": "ðeə", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "In or at that place.", "meaning_fa": "آنجا", "example_en": "The book is over there.", "photo": "media/vocab/there.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/there.mp3"}, {"word": "thick [not thin]", "phonetic": "θɪk", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "having a large distance between opposite sides.", "meaning_fa": "ضخیم، کلفت", "example_en": "The book has a very thick cover.", "photo": "media/vocab/thick-not-thin.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/thick-not-thin.mp3"}, {"word": "thin", "phonetic": "θɪn", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "having little fat on the body.", "meaning_fa": "لاغر", "example_en": "She is tall and very thin.", "photo": "media/vocab/thin.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/thin.mp3"}, {"word": "through", "phonetic": "θruː", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "from one side or end to the other.", "meaning_fa": "از میان، از طریق", "example_en": "We walked through the forest.", "photo": "media/vocab/through.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/through.mp3"}, {"word": "tiny", "phonetic": "ˈtaɪni", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "extremely small.", "meaning_fa": "بسیار کوچک، ریز", "example_en": "The baby wore tiny shoes.", "photo": "media/vocab/tiny.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/tiny.mp3"}, {"word": "top", "phonetic": "tɒp", "levels": ["a2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "A piece of clothing worn on the upper body.", "meaning_fa": "بلوز، تاپ", "example_en": "She bought a new blue top.", "photo": "media/vocab/top.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/top.mp3"}, {"word": "towards", "phonetic": "təˈwɔːdz", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "In the direction of.", "meaning_fa": "به سمت، به طرف", "example_en": "She walked towards the door.", "photo": "media/vocab/towards.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/towards.mp3"}, {"word": "under [movement]", "phonetic": "ˈʌndə", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Moving below or beneath something.", "meaning_fa": "زیر، از زیر", "example_en": "The cat ran under the table.", "photo": "media/vocab/under-movement.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/under-movement.mp3"}, {"word": "underneath", "phonetic": "ˌʌndəˈniːθ", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "preposition", "meaning_en": "Directly below something else.", "meaning_fa": "زیر، در زیر", "example_en": "The cat is hiding underneath the bed.", "photo": "media/vocab/underneath.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/underneath.mp3"}, {"word": "up [further along]", "phonetic": "ʌp", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adverb", "meaning_en": "Towards a higher place or further along a path.", "meaning_fa": "بالا، جلوتر", "example_en": "The shop is just up the road.", "photo": "media/vocab/up-further-along.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/up-further-along.mp3"}, {"word": "wide", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "measuring a large distance from side to side", "meaning_fa": "پهن، عریض", "example_en": "The river is very wide here.", "photo": "media/vocab/wide.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/wide.mp3"}, {"word": "wide [not narrow]", "phonetic": "waɪd", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "adjective", "meaning_en": "having a large distance from side to side", "meaning_fa": "پهن، عریض", "example_en": "The road is wide enough for two cars.", "photo": "media/vocab/wide-not-narrow.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/wide-not-narrow.mp3"}, {"word": "widen", "phonetic": null, "levels": ["b2"], "pos": "verb", "meaning_en": "to make or become wider", "meaning_fa": "پهن کردن، عریض کردن", "example_en": "They plan to widen the road.", "photo": "media/vocab/widen.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/widen.mp3"}, {"word": "width", "phonetic": "wɪtθ", "levels": ["b1", "b2"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "the distance from side to side", "meaning_fa": "عرض، پهنا", "example_en": "What is the width of the table?", "photo": "media/vocab/width.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/width.mp3"}, {"word": "yard", "phonetic": "jɑːd", "levels": ["b1"], "pos": "noun", "meaning_en": "An area of ground next to a house.", "meaning_fa": "حیاط", "example_en": "The children played in the yard.", "photo": "media/vocab/yard.jpg", "audio": "https://pub-b26d6db3b0dd4beeb7e10e9ab20e4012.r2.dev/yard.mp3"}]